1
00:00:45,723 --> 00:00:49,423
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,363
=Episode 2=

3
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:53,761
Any demon slain by a Hunter

4
00:00:53,761 --> 00:00:55,001
turns into Demon Essence

5
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:56,481
and is sealed within this token.

6
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:58,560
Essence is ranked from one to nine.

7
00:00:58,761 --> 00:01:01,921
The Demon Hunting Bureau ranks you up

8
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:03,361
based on the Essence you collect.

9
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:07,441
This demon can be your entrance exam.

10
00:01:19,841 --> 00:01:20,640
Yuanlang.

11
00:01:22,481 --> 00:01:23,281
Hungry again?

12
00:01:25,761 --> 00:01:27,120
This ghost chef's not bad!

13
00:01:27,321 --> 00:01:28,120
Come on, come on!

14
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:31,001
Eat, eat, eat.
That's all you do, you glutton.

15
00:01:31,841 --> 00:01:33,200
- Eat up. Let's go.
- Let's go.

16
00:01:34,881 --> 00:01:37,200
Wait for your lovable and hungry senior!

17
00:01:38,214 --> 00:01:42,755
(Longevity)

18
00:01:54,961 --> 00:01:55,600
He...

19
00:01:56,080 --> 00:01:57,120
was scared to death?

20
00:01:59,001 --> 00:01:59,801
Don't be afraid.

21
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:02,441
The demonic energy is thick here.

22
00:02:02,881 --> 00:02:04,281
The demon is still nearby.

23
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,961
(Watch me fool you.)

24
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,921
(This time I'll definitely eat you.)

25
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:11,160
This is a Love Demon.

26
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:13,040
A hopeless romantic, too.

27
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,520
It won't show itself

28
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,441
unless it sees a wedding ceremony.

29
00:02:15,841 --> 00:02:16,720
Love Demon?

30
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,520
I come from the Void Realm.

31
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,200
I know every demon.

32
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:21,921
This demon envies those
who have true love

33
00:02:21,921 --> 00:02:22,801
and tries to hurt them.

34
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:25,281
That's why it only preys on newlyweds.

35
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,401
Something's off.

36
00:02:28,401 --> 00:02:31,281
The groom's clothes
and the wedding dress are here.

37
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:33,520
But where's the bride?

38
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:37,720
The demon must have taken her.

39
00:02:38,001 --> 00:02:39,080
The Love Demon killed the groom

40
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:42,200
and took the bride
to practice some dark magic.

41
00:02:43,801 --> 00:02:45,281
If we want to rescue the bride,

42
00:02:45,401 --> 00:02:47,361
we need to hold a wedding ceremony

43
00:02:47,361 --> 00:02:48,361
to lure it out.

44
00:02:48,361 --> 00:02:49,361
A wedding ceremony?

45
00:02:55,961 --> 00:02:57,401
Young Taoist.

46
00:02:57,401 --> 00:02:58,680
Have you ever been married?

47
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:02,841
N-No, I haven't.

48
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,600
What are you planning?

49
00:03:14,550 --> 00:03:18,682
(Longevity)

50
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,441
Darling.

51
00:04:03,401 --> 00:04:05,120
Yuanchu is still young.

52
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:07,080
He knows nothing of romance.

53
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:10,321
Why didn't she pick me as the groom?

54
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,200
Ridiculous.

55
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:17,120
It's all just an act.

56
00:04:17,961 --> 00:04:19,160
Catching the demon is what matters.

57
00:04:24,001 --> 00:04:24,801
It's so good.

58
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:40,600
In your mortal world,

59
00:04:41,961 --> 00:04:43,600
should I call you...

60
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,001
Husband?

61
00:04:48,921 --> 00:04:50,520
Or perhaps...

62
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:53,240
Darling?

63
00:04:54,401 --> 00:04:55,720
Or...

64
00:05:02,801 --> 00:05:03,841
My beloved?

65
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,680
These are things married couples do.

66
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:09,401
What we're doing...

67
00:05:11,761 --> 00:05:12,600
isn't right.

68
00:05:13,170 --> 00:05:14,003
Oh.

69
00:05:18,801 --> 00:05:21,801
I'll take responsibility for you.

70
00:05:43,321 --> 00:05:47,160
Don't waste a night like this.

71
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:59,160
Young Taoist, you can't escape.

72
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:16,361
You pesky Taoist! You... I...

73
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:20,361
You've turned into a man?

74
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:35,921
(Whose face is this?)

75
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:41,600
Did he affect

76
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,481
the Stone Curse

77
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,680
and reverse my Yin and Yang?

78
00:06:46,881 --> 00:06:49,040
Are you poison or cure?

79
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,200
I don't want to be a man!

80
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:51,520
I don't want to be a man!

81
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:52,361
Turn me back!

82
00:06:52,361 --> 00:06:54,080
You have to have a way!

83
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:55,080
Actually...

84
00:06:56,321 --> 00:06:57,240
this isn't that bad.

85
00:07:00,001 --> 00:07:02,321
Makes things easier on the road.

86
00:07:04,881 --> 00:07:06,481
It must be the Spirit-Calling Art
gone wrong.

87
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:07,481
Let me try it on you again.

88
00:07:07,481 --> 00:07:08,441
Maybe that'll fix it.

89
00:07:08,881 --> 00:07:09,801
Spirit-Calling Art?

90
00:07:10,481 --> 00:07:11,841
What did you do to me?

91
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,560
Man to man. No touching.

92
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,361
Back off.

93
00:07:17,401 --> 00:07:18,200
Keep your distance.

94
00:07:25,010 --> 00:07:26,757
(Longevity)

95
00:07:35,961 --> 00:07:39,560
(On Ghost Festival night,
a bride is wed.)

96
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:43,040
(Her kinfolk weep as tears are shed.)

97
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:47,040
(In paper red, she's for the dead.)

98
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:50,881
(Her living groom,
she'll never see again.)

99
00:07:51,761 --> 00:07:53,160
That's not the demon's true form.

100
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,560
It's the Deceit Beast!

101
00:07:55,801 --> 00:07:56,361
Deceit Beast?

102
00:07:56,801 --> 00:07:58,120
You said it was a Love Demon.

103
00:07:59,001 --> 00:07:59,961
No time to explain!

104
00:07:59,961 --> 00:08:00,961
Just turn me back first!

105
00:08:01,001 --> 00:08:01,720
Kiss me first!

106
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,761
Kiss me! Hurry!

107
00:08:02,761 --> 00:08:06,841
(On Ghost Festival night,
a bride is wed.)

108
00:08:07,401 --> 00:08:11,441
(Her kinfolk weep as if she's dead.)

109
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:15,240
(Longevity
In paper red, she's for the dead.)

110
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:21,001
(Her living groom,
she'll never see again.)

111
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,160
Break.

112
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,601
The Deceit Beast has powerful illusions

113
00:09:23,841 --> 00:09:25,160
but weak demonic power.

114
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:28,320
You've harmed innocent villagers,

115
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,440
committing all kinds of evil.

116
00:09:29,521 --> 00:09:31,561
Return the bride you took, now.

117
00:09:31,921 --> 00:09:34,360
There are no innocents in this village.

118
00:09:37,721 --> 00:09:39,080
Just like them,

119
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,480
both of you deserve to die!

120
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:12,320
A barrier.

121
00:10:12,841 --> 00:10:14,921
It must be moving brides through

122
00:10:14,921 --> 00:10:15,881
every household's well.

123
00:10:15,881 --> 00:10:16,400
Young Taoist.

124
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:17,280
Stay close.

125
00:10:37,948 --> 00:10:41,876
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

126
00:10:42,148 --> 00:10:45,321
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

127
00:10:45,362 --> 00:10:48,876
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

128
00:10:49,062 --> 00:10:51,996
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

129
00:10:52,276 --> 00:10:59,046
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

130
00:10:59,692 --> 00:11:06,380
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

131
00:11:07,286 --> 00:11:10,956
♪Let towering waves come crashing down,
I'll fight against the tide♪

132
00:11:11,066 --> 00:11:14,756
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

133
00:11:14,928 --> 00:11:21,162
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
